{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 2 of the [[1954 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place from 17 to 23 June 1954. The group consisted of [[Hungary national football team|Hungary]], [[South Korea national football team|South Korea]], [[Turkey national football team|Turkey]], and [[Germany national football team|West Germany]].<ref>{{cite web |last1=Stokkermans |first1=Karel |last2=Jarreta |first2=Sergio Henrique |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/54f.html |title=World Cup 1954 (Switzerland, June 16 – July 4) |website=RSSSF.com |publisher=[[Rec.Sport.Soccer Statistics Foundation]] |date=22 October 1999 |access-date=22 May 2018}}</ref>

